From d670d3a0c81d86366accba8ce4defeb3e3b803f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:40:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: translate the Itemfinder, Hall of Fame, Mailbox and
 mail screen overlays (28, 34, 56, 64, 103)

Static audit of the remaining [SS-MISSING] stubs: these overlays are only reachable through pointer tables or app templates, so the translator never rooted them and the game would abort when the feature opens (Itemfinder, Hall of Fame showcase after the Elite Four/Red, PC Mailbox, mail screen, Start menu action 12). Seed the whole overlay files (as 0134 and 0141 did) and drop the fourteen matching Missing() lines.
---
 .../nitromain-perf/missing.c                       | 14 --------------
 .../maploader/seed-files.json                      |  7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

